{"ID":"20240506110126-t0v4nqh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110126-t0v4nqh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110126-t0v4nqh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704081102-jbtm7v0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614093626-iah0v5u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704081102-jbtm7v0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"358补01青盐（戎盐）","type":"doc","updated":"20240704080726"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240822094429-iul86sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822094429-iul86sn","updated":"20240822094429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"青盐"}]},{"ID":"20240822094429-upxcbx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822094429-upxcbx0","updated":"20240822094429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 408px;","style":"width: 398px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青盐"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青盐-20240822094149-zfujm3g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 398px;\" parent-style=\"width: 408px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822094429-i6csapd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822094429-i6csapd","updated":"20240822094429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青盐 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青盐 1-20240822094232-sids16v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822094429-ovaucl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822094429-ovaucl7","updated":"20240822094429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青盐 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青盐 2-20240822094310-jndctx2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822094429-262x68a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822094429-262x68a","updated":"20240822094429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 672px;","style":"width: 662px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青盐 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青盐 3-20240822094351-1dzozt8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 662px;\" parent-style=\"width: 672px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704080726-odk9sbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704080726-odk9sbm","updated":"20240704080726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 856px;","style":"width: 846px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青盐5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青盐5-20240627162211-ee9dms8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 846px;\" parent-style=\"width: 856px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614093624-kfe6r8b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093624-kfe6r8b"}},{"ID":"20240614093857-mlb809g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-mlb809g","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-myev0u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-myev0u4","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目。目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-hts1a4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-hts1a4z","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大盐，令人吐（《御览》引云，主肠胃结热，《大观本》，作黑字）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-3q0mu2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-3q0mu2f","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卤盐，味苦寒，主大热，消渴狂烦，除邪及下蛊毒，柔肌肤（《御览》引云，一名寒石，明目益气）。生池泽（旧作三种，今并）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-6bohee3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-6bohee3","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰戎盐，一名胡盐，生胡盐山，及西羌，北地，酒泉，福禄城东南角，北海青，南海赤，十月采，大盐，生邯郸又河东，卤盐，生河东盐池。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-tfmqzlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-tfmqzlw","updated":"20240614093857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：盐咸也，古者宿沙初作煮海盐，卤，西方咸地也，从西省象盐形，安定有卤县，东方谓之斥，西方谓之卤盐，河东盐池，袤五十一里，广七里，周百十六里。北山经云：景山南望盐贩之泽。郭璞云：即解县盐池也，今在河东猗氏县，案在山西安邑运城。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093857-r88vsuz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093857-r88vsuz","updated":"20240614093857"}},{"ID":"20240614093738-qhvuw64","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-qhvuw64","updated":"20240614093747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-80n7x95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-80n7x95","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《本经》下品）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-tb7xvep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-tb7xvep","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖释名〗胡盐（《别录》）羌盐（《日华》）青盐（《纲目》）秃登盐（《唐本》）阴土盐。（[大明曰]西番所食者，故号戎盐、羌盐。〔恭曰〕：戎盐，即胡盐也。沙州名秃登盐，廓州名为阴土盐，生河岸山坂之阴土石间，故名）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-4drm0vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-4drm0vi","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖集解〗〔别录曰〕戎盐生胡盐山，及西羌北地、酒泉福禄城东南角。北海青，南海赤。十月采。〔当之曰〕戎盐味苦臭，是海潮水浇山石，经久盐凝着石，取之北海者青，南海者赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-smfgfq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-smfgfq8","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔弘景曰〕史书言虏中盐有九种：白盐、食盐，常食者；黑盐，主腹胀气满；胡盐，主耳聋目痛；柔盐，主马脊疮；又有赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐四种，并不入食。马齿即大盐，黑盐疑是卤碱，柔盐疑是戎盐，而此戎盐又名胡盐，二三相乱。今戎盐虏中甚有，从凉州来，亦从敦煌来。其形作块片，或如鸡鸭卵，或如菱米，色紫白，味不甚咸，口尝气臭正如毈鸡子臭者乃真。又河南盐池泥中，自有凝盐如石片，打破皆方，青黑色，善疗马脊疮，又疑此是戎盐。又巴东朐䏰县北崖有盐井，盐水自凝，生伞子盐，方一二寸，中央突张如伞形，亦有方如石膏、博棋者。〔恭曰〕戎盐即胡盐，生河崖山坂之阴土石间，大小不常，坚白似石，烧之不鸣炨也。〔宗奭曰〕戎盐成垛，裁之如枕，细白，味甘、咸。〔颂曰〕陶氏所说九种，今人不能遍识。医家治眼及补下药多用青盐，恐即戎盐也。《本草》云：北海青，南海赤。今青盐从西羌来者，形块方棱，明莹而青黑色，最奇。北海来者，作大块而不光莹，又多孔窍，若蜂窠状，色亦浅于西盐，彼人谓之盐枕，入药差劣。北胡又有一种盐，作片屑，如碎白石，彼人亦谓之青盐，缄封于匣，与盐枕并作礼贽，不知是何色类。〔时珍曰〕本草戎盐云，北海青，南海赤，而诸注乃用白盐，似与本文不合。按《凉州异物志》云：姜赖之墟，今称龙城。刚卤千里，蒺藜之形。其下有盐，累棋而生。出于胡国，故名戎盐。赞云：盐山二岳，二色为质。赤者如丹，黑者如漆。小大从意，镂之为物。作兽辟恶，佩之为吉。或称戎盐，可以疗疾。此说与《本草》本方相合，亦惟赤、黑二色，不言白者。盖白者乃光明盐，而青盐、赤盐则戎盐也。故《西凉记》云：青盐池出盐，正方半寸，其形如石，甚甜美。《真腊记》云：山间有石，味胜于盐，可琢为器。《梁杰公传》言，交河之间，掘碛下数尺，有紫盐，如红如紫，色鲜而甘。其下丈许，有瑿珀。《北户录》亦言，张掖池中出桃花盐，色如桃花，随月盈缩。今宁夏近凉州地，盐井所出青盐，四方皎洁如石。山丹卫即张掖地，有池产红盐，红色。此二盐，即戎盐之青、赤二色者。医方但用青盐，而不用红盐，不知二盐皆名戎盐也。所谓南海、北海者，指西海之南北而言，非炎方之南海也。张果《玉洞要诀》云：赤戎盐出西戎，禀自然水土之气，结而成质。其地水土之气黄赤，故盐亦随土气而生。味淡于石盐，力能伏阳精。但于火中烧汁红赤，凝定色转益者，即真也。亦名绛盐。《抱朴子》书有作赤盐法。又岭南一种红盐，乃染成者，皆非真红盐也。又《丹房镜源》云：蛮盐可伏雌雄，红盐为上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-6xdfqzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-6xdfqzy","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖气味〗咸，寒，无毒。（〔宗奭曰〕甘、咸。〔大明曰〕平。〔独孤滔曰〕戎盐，赤、黑二色，能累卵，干汞，制丹砂）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-k5c82ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-k5c82ll","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖主治〗明目目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊。（《本经》）心腹前，溺血吐血，齿舌血出。（《别录》）助水脏，益精气，除五脏癥结，心腹积聚，痛疮疥癣。（大明）解芫青、斑蝥毒。（时珍）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-9wol2xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-9wol2xd","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖发明〗〔宗奭曰〕戎盐甘咸，功在却血、入肾，治目中瘀赤涩昏。〔时珍曰〕戎盐功同食盐，不经煎炼，而味咸带甘，入药似胜。《周礼》注云，饴盐味甜，即戎盐，不知果否?或云以饴拌盐也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-b3swmwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-b3swmwf","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〖附方〗（新六）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-klzlavi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-klzlavi","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便不通：（戎盐汤：用戎盐弹丸大一枚，茯苓半斤，白术二两，水煎，服之。《仲景金匮方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-wlwc8zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-wlwc8zl","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风热牙痛：（青盐一斤，槐枝半斤，水四碗，煎汁二碗，煮盐至干，炒研。日用揩牙洗目。《唐氏经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-8r6sh7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-8r6sh7i","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牢牙明目：（青盐二两，白盐四两，川椒四两，煎汁拌盐炒干。日用揩牙洗目，永无齿疾目疾。《通变要法》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-h7t5bza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-h7t5bza","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风眼烂弦：（戎盐化水，点之。《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093738-zzstm2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093738-zzstm2d","updated":"20240614093738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痔疮漏疮：（白矾四两，青盐四两，为末，猪尿脬一个盛之，阴干。每服五钱，空心温水下。《赵氏经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093624-uchmr1m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093624-uchmr1m"}},{"ID":"20240614093726-v3vz4ob","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093726-v3vz4ob","updated":"20240614093731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093726-6jrglv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093726-6jrglv3","updated":"20240614093726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名青盐．补肾、泻血热．"}]},{"ID":"20240614093726-l8j27fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093726-l8j27fo","updated":"20240614093726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸而寒．入肝肾．助水脏．平血热．治目痛赤涩．（散肝经风热．）吐血溺血，齿舌出血，坚骨固齿．（擦牙良．）明目乌须．功同食盐而更胜之．出西羌．不假煎炼．方棱明莹色青者良．（风眼烂弦、戎盐化水点之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093917-yco44nd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093917-yco44nd"}},{"ID":"20240614093918-gclsnce","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093918-gclsnce","updated":"20240614093923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093918-9i8550y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093918-9i8550y","updated":"20240614093918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名石盐，俗名青盐，与光明盐同类"}]},{"ID":"20240614093918-ghd05sz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093918-ghd05sz","updated":"20240614093918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093918-46kxn89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093918-46kxn89","updated":"20240614093918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主明目，目痛，益气，坚筋骨，去毒盅。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093918-l8jogyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093918-l8jogyo","updated":"20240614093918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐禀至阴之气凝结而成，不经煎炼，生涯 之阴，功专走血入肾，治目中瘀赤昏涩。《金匮》茯苓戎盐汤治小便不通，取其补肾利膀胱也。又能固齿明目，治目痛；益气，坚筋骨，一皆补肾之力。《本经》首主明目，目痛，是热淫于内，治以咸寒。又言去毒蛊者，咸能软坚，蛊毒邪气不能浮长矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094016-c43f45s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094016-c43f45s"}},{"ID":"20240614094018-jj6gt2s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094018-jj6gt2s","updated":"20240614094022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094018-qb3c5gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094018-qb3c5gt","updated":"20240614094018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目、目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒虫。味咸，寒，无毒。疗心腹痛，溺血，吐血，齿舌血出。一名胡盐，生胡盐山，及西羌北地，及酒泉福禄城东南角。北海青，南海赤。十月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094018-ve1z7s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094018-ve1z7s9","updated":"20240614094018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今俗中不复见卤咸，唯魏国所献虏盐，即是河东大盐，形如结冰圆强，味咸、苦，夏月小润液。虏中盐乃有九种∶白盐，食盐，常食者；黑盐，疗腹胀气满；胡盐，疗耳聋目痛；柔盐，疗马脊疮；又有赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐四种，并不入食。马齿即大盐，黑盐疑是卤咸，柔盐疑是戎盐，而此戎盐又名胡盐，兼疗眼痛，二、三相乱。今戎盐虏中甚有，从凉州来，芮芮河南使及北部胡客从敦煌来，亦得之，自是希少尔。其形作块片，或如鸡鸭卵、或如菱米，色紫白，味不甚咸，口尝气臭，正如 鸡子臭者言是真。又河南盐池泥中，自有凝盐如石片，打破皆方，青黑色，善疗马脊疮，又疑此或者。盐虽多种，而戎盐、卤咸最为要用。又巴东朐 县北岸有盐井，盐水自凝生粥子盐，方一、二寸，中央突张如伞形，亦有方如石膏、博棋者。李云戎盐味苦、臭，是海潮水浇山石，经久盐凝着石取之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094018-kj3wsvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094018-kj3wsvb","updated":"20240614094018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"北海者青，南海者紫又云卤咸即是人煮盐釜底凝强盐滓，如此二说并未详。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094018-e6gptsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094018-e6gptsd","updated":"20240614094018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕陶称卤咸，疑是黑盐，此是咸土，议如前说，其戎盐即胡盐。沙州名为秃登盐，廊州名为阴土盐，生河岸山坡之阴土石间，块大小不常，坚白似石，烧之不鸣 者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094029-02msda2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094029-02msda2"}},{"ID":"20240614094030-7j5e67w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094030-7j5e67w","updated":"20240614094034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094030-h9dasaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094030-h9dasaw","updated":"20240614094030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌血出。一名胡盐。生胡盐山，及西羌北地，及酒泉福禄城东南角，北海青，南海赤。十月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094030-g8929dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094030-g8929dd","updated":"20240614094030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今世中不复见卤咸，唯魏国所献虏盐，即是河东大盐，形如结冰圆强，味咸、苦，夏月小润液。虏中盐乃有九种∶白盐，食盐，常食者；黑盐，治腹胀气满；胡盐，治耳聋目痛；柔盐，治马脊疮；又有赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐四种，并不入食。马齿即大盐，黑盐疑是卤咸，柔盐疑是戎盐，而此戎盐又名胡盐，兼治眼痛，二、三相乱。今戎盐虏中甚有，从凉州来，芮芮河南使及北部胡客从敦煌来，亦得之，自是稀少尔。其形作块片，或如鸡鸭卵，或如菱米，色紫白，味不甚咸，口尝气臭，正如 鸡子臭者言是真。又河南盐池泥中，自有凝盐如石片，打破皆方，青黑色，善治马脊疮，又疑此或者。盐虽多种，而戎盐、卤咸最为要用。又巴东朐 县北岸大有盐井，盐水自凝生粥子盐，方一、二寸，中央突张如伞形，亦有方如石膏、博棋者。李云戎盐味苦、臭，是海潮水浇山石。经久盐凝着石取之。北海者青，南海者紫赤。又云卤咸即是人煮盐釜底凝强盐滓，如此二说并未详。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094005-om5x9gl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614094005-om5x9gl"}},{"ID":"20240614094006-zo6h33x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614094006-zo6h33x","updated":"20240614094010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食盐《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614094006-q6p0gmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094006-q6p0gmf","updated":"20240614094006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食盐，旧不着所出州郡。陶隐居云∶有东海、北海盐及河东盐池，梁、益有盐井，交广有南海盐，西羌有山盐，胡中有木盐，而色类不同，以河东者为胜。河东盐，今解州、安邑两池所种盐，最为精好是也。又有并州两监末盐。乃刮碱（音减）煎炼，不甚佳。其碱盖下品所着卤碱，生河东盐池者，谓此也。下品又有大盐，生邯郸及河东池泽。苏恭云∶大盐即河东印盐，人之常食者，形粗于末盐，乃似今解盐也。解人取盐，于池旁耕地，沃以池水，每临南风急，则宿昔成盐满畦，彼人谓之种盐。东海、北海、南海盐者，今沧、密、楚、秀、温、台、明、泉、福、广、琼、化诸州，官场煮海水作之，以给民食者，又谓之泽盐，医方所谓海盐是也。其煮盐之器，汉谓之牢盆，今或鼓铁为之，或编竹为之，上下周以蜃灰，广丈深尺，平底，置于灶背，谓之盐盘。《南越志》所谓织篾为鼎，和以牡蛎是也。然后于海滨掘地为坑，上布竹木，覆以蓬茅，又积沙于其上。每潮汐冲沙，卤碱淋于坑中。水退则以火炬照之，卤气冲火皆灭。因取海卤注盘中煎之，顷刻而就。管子曰∶齐有渠展之盐，伐菹薪煮海水征积之，十月始生，至于正月成三万是也。菹薪谓以茅菹然火也。梁、益盐井者，今归州及西川诸郡，皆有盐井，汲其水以煎作盐，如煮海之法，但以食彼方之民耳。西羌山盐，胡中木盐者，即下条云光明盐，生盐州。下品有戎盐，生胡盐山及西羌北地，酒泉福禄城东南角。北海青，南海赤者是也。然羌胡之盐，种类自多。陶注又云∶虏中盐有九种，白盐、食盐常食者。黑盐、柔盐、赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐之类，今人不能遍识。医家治眼及补下药多用青盐，疑此即戎盐。而《本经》云∶北海青，南海赤。今青盐从西羌来者，形块方棱，明莹而青黑色，最奇。北胡来者，作大块，而不光莹，又多孔窍，若蜂窠状，色亦浅于西盐，彼人谓之盐枕，入药差劣。北胡又有一种盐，作片屑，如碎白石，彼人亦谓之青盐，缄封于匣中，与盐枕并作礼贽，不知是何色类。又阶州出一种石盐，生山石中，不由煎炼，自然成盐，色甚明莹，彼人甚贵之，云即光明盐也。医方所不用，故不能尽分别也。又通、泰、海州，并有停户刮碱煎盐输官，如并州末盐之类，以供给江湖，极为饶衍，其味乃优于并州末盐也。滨州亦有人户煎炼草土盐，其色最粗黑，不堪入药，但可啖马耳。又下有绿盐条云∶以光明盐、 砂、赤铜屑酿之为块，绿色，真者出焉耆国水中石下取之，状若扁青、空青，今不闻识此者，医方亦不用。唐柳柳州纂救三死治霍乱盐汤方云∶元和十一年十月，得干霍乱，上不可吐，下不可利，出冷汗三大斗许，气即绝。河南房伟传此汤，入口即吐，绝气复通。其法用盐一大匙，熬令黄，童子小便一升，二物温和服之，少顷吐下即愈。刘禹锡《传信方》，着崔中丞炼盐黑丸方∶盐一升，捣末，内粗瓷瓶中实，筑泥头讫，初以火烧，渐渐加炭火，勿令瓶破，候赤彻，盐如水汁，即去火，其盐冷即凝，破瓶取之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094006-rqgdxqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094006-rqgdxqt","updated":"20240614094006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豉一升熬焦，桃仁一大两，和麸熬令熟，巴豆二大两，去心膜，纸中熬令油出，须生熟得所，熟即少力，生又损人，四物各用研捣成熟药，秤量蜜和丸如梧子，每服三丸，皆平旦时服。天行时气，豉汁及茶下并得。服后多吃茶汁行药力。心痛，酒下，入口便止。血痢，饮下，初变水痢，后便止。鬼疟，茶饮下。骨热，白蜜汤下。忌冷浆水。合药久，则丸稍加令大。凡服药后吐痢，勿怪。服药一日，忌口两日。吐痢若多，即煎黄连汁服止之。平旦服药，至小食时以来，不吐痢者，或遇杀药人，即更服一、两丸投之。其药，冬中合，腊月尤佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094006-at83dg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094006-at83dg9","updated":"20240614094006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓷合子中盛贮，以腊纸封之，勿令泄气。清河崔能云∶合得一剂，可救百人。天行时气，卒急觅诸药不得，又恐过时，或在道途，或在村落，无诸药可求，但将此药一刀圭，即敌大黄、朴硝数两，曾试有效。宜行于闾里间，及所使辈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614094006-82b1nlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614094006-82b1nlk","updated":"20240614094006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小儿、女子不可服，多被搅作耳。唐方又有药盐法，出于张文仲。唐之大夫多作之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093954-gx57aqh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093954-gx57aqh"}},{"ID":"20240614093955-vwzws3z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093955-vwzws3z","updated":"20240614093959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青盐《雷公炮制药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093955-bdhkbw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093955-bdhkbw8","updated":"20240614093955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，性寒无毒，入肾经。主明目。止痛益气，坚筋骨，助水脏，除心腹痛。破聚癣疥疮。一名戎盐，一名胡盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093955-byh4stz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093955-byh4stz","updated":"20240614093955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶青盐味咸，肾所宜也，故独入之，水脏既补，则明目坚骨等功，何足异耶？"}]},{"ID":"20240614093938-jp9227c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093938-jp9227c"}},{"ID":"20240614093939-g8b7sny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-g8b7sny","updated":"20240614093945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《药征续编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-b528jra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-b528jra","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯苓戎盐汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-d8a0luq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-d8a0luq","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上一方。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-bnzupjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-bnzupjc","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【品考】"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-pgs7qht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-pgs7qht","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐，即青盐，说详于诸家本草可考。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-a44u833","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-a44u833","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【辨误】"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-9imzshg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-9imzshg","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍本草附方引此方，曰∶小便不通，戎盐汤，用戎盐弹丸大一枚，茯苓半斤，白术二两，水煎服之。仲景《金匮》方云云。按∶《金匮要略》作小便不利。夫不利与不通，其证不同，不利者，虽少少利之亦不快利之谓也。不通者，决不通利之谓也。即小便闭是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-7yple10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-7yple10","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故仲景于此方，谓之不利，而不谓之不通也。今考其病证，有所不同者，又戎盐汤上脱茯苓二字，唯分两不异而已。至谓水煎服之，则略其煮法，何其疏漏乎？又云∶仲景《金匮》方，夫时珍之取仲景之方，往往如此。或云张仲景《金匮要略》，或云《金匮玉函方》，引其书各，亦不一定，录其煮法，不多略之。至如略引其书，则无害于治，今录其煮法服度，则恒医苟取其法以施之病患，岂惟不无益其病而大害于其治矣。时珍之作本草也，其疏漏亦往往如此。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093939-5ku9rbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093939-5ku9rbm","updated":"20240614093939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"况至于品目，其庶物亦自有阙略失其真者，天下医人，何其心醉彼人矣乎？"}]},{"ID":"20240614093928-djb0sst","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093928-djb0sst"}},{"ID":"20240614093929-aor8osk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093929-aor8osk","updated":"20240614093933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093929-63mlafg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093929-63mlafg","updated":"20240614093929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，无毒。主明目目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊，心腹痛，溺血，吐血，血出。一名胡盐。生胡盐山，及西羌北地酒泉福禄城东南角。北海青，南海赤。十月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093909-wokqg62","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093909-wokqg62"}},{"ID":"20240614093910-eu2gwp7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-eu2gwp7","updated":"20240614093913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-3lc7t2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-3lc7t2u","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】戎盐，主明目，目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-c8729ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-c8729ee","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大盐，令人吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-0erlk34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-0erlk34","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卤盐，味苦寒，主大热，消渴狂烦，除邪及下蛊毒，柔肌肤。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-4po4lp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-4po4lp3","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，微寒，入足太阳膀胱经。清膀胱而泻热，开癃闭而利水。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-vs1rok4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-vs1rok4","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓戎盐汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓半斤，戎盐弹丸大，白术二两。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治小便不利。以其土湿则水道不利，术、苓，燥土而泻湿，戎盐利水而泻热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-vbep4n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-vbep4n8","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐咸寒之性，直走膀胱，而清痰热，长于利水。其诸主治，能止吐血尿血，齿舌诸血，以咸走血而清清降也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093910-8i1kqhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093910-8i1kqhk","updated":"20240614093910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸而甘，入药殊胜食盐之苦，即青盐也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093846-gg0a1re","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093846-gg0a1re"}},{"ID":"20240614093717-g117xmd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-g117xmd","updated":"20240614093721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-wvzh3z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-wvzh3z9","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经下品）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-s6kh8vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-s6kh8vo","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】咸寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-48v9bnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-48v9bnl","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主明目，目痛，益气，坚筋骨，去毒蛊。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-81p5a41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-81p5a41","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶戎盐，即青盐，亦赤盐也。史书言虏中盐有九种∶曰白盐、食盐、黑盐、胡盐、柔盐、赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐，而戎盐即胡盐。日华一名羌盐，《唐本》一名秃登盐，大明一名阴土盐，生河崖山 之阴土石间也，大小不尝，形作块片，间有方棱，或如鸡卵，或如菱米，坚结似石，色玄紫白，味不甚咸，臭若 鸡之气，烧之不鸣 者是也。凉州异物志云∶姜赖之墟，今称龙城。刚卤千里，蒺藜之形。其下有盐，累棋而生。又云∶盐山二岳，二色为质，赤者如丹，黑者如漆。小大从意，镂之为物。作兽辟恶，佩之为吉。或称戎盐，可以疗疾。张果《玉洞要诀》云∶赤戎盐，生西戎，禀自然水土之气，结而成质。其地水土之气黄赤，故盐时，色益赤者为真。再烧之最久，赤转为青矣。故一名绛盐。西凉记云∶有青盐池，出青盐，正方寸半，其形如石，味甚甘美。真腊记云∶山间有石，味胜于盐，可琢为器。梁杰公传云∶交河之间，掘碛下数尺有紫盐，如红如紫，色鲜而甘。其下丈许，必有 珀。北户录云∶张掖池中生桃花盐，色如桃花，随月盈缩。今宁夏近凉州地，盐井所出青盐，四方皎洁如石。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-e7gy67u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-e7gy67u","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山丹卫，即张掖地，有池产盐红色。此二盐者，即戎盐之青、赤二盐也。今方书但用青盐，不用赤盐，并目赤盐为异物矣。本草云∶北海产青盐，南海产赤盐，总从西戎来。所谓南北者，指西海之南北耳。岭南一种红盐，用色染成，非真赤盐也，烧之出白汁，凝定仍转白色矣。丹房 源云∶蛮盐可伏雌雄，唯赤盐为上。独孤滔云∶戎盐累卵，干 ，制土砂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-5ov0tvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-5ov0tvw","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶煮海为盐，若戎盐者，钟海水自然之精气，不假人力为也。生海北者黑如漆，海不越水火为色，递以水火为胜劣，亦递以水火为功用也。故主精明眼识为缘，生于眼识，盖识精缘水为根，缘明为尘，尘为火用，根为火体故尔。若益气坚筋骨，去毒蛊，此宝明澄湛之休征耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093717-dhtqieb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093717-dhtqieb","updated":"20240614093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（宝明即火，澄湛即水。经云∶宝明生润，水从火出矣。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093625-ro1kwbk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093625-ro1kwbk"}},{"ID":"20240614093708-1adttov","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-1adttov","updated":"20240614093711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093708-bjyukts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-bjyukts","updated":"20240614093708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即青盐。来自羌戎胡地。又名羌盐胡盐。北海青。南海赤。（指西海之南北而言）此戎盐之青赤二色者。医方但用青盐。而不用红盐。不知二盐皆名戎盐也。（西凉记。青盐池出盐正方半寸。其形如石。甚甜美。北户录。张掖池中出桃花盐。色如桃花。随月盈缩。）赞云。盐山二岳。二色为质。赤者如丹。黑者如漆。或称戎盐。可以疗疾。此说亦惟赤黑二色。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093708-vib6rsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-vib6rsp","updated":"20240614093708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不言白者。盖白者乃光明盐。而青盐赤盐则戎盐也。（本濒湖）气味咸寒。功同食盐。不经煎炼而味咸带甘。入药似胜。主助水脏。益精气。明目疗目痛心腹痛。溺血吐血。齿舌出血。除五脏症结。心腹积聚。坚肌骨。去毒蛊。（诸本草）方书治眩晕胀满。腰痛遗精。白浊劳淋。小便不禁。戎盐甘咸。功在却血入肾。治目中瘀赤涩昏。二盐并用方荔核散。治疝气。阴核肿大。痛不可忍。新荔枝核十四枚烧灰存性。八角茴香（炒）沉香木香青盐食盐各一钱。川楝肉小茴香各二钱。为细末。每服三钱。空心热酒调服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093708-cbjyxbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-cbjyxbq","updated":"20240614093708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牢牙明目。青盐二两。白盐四两。川椒四两。煎汁。拌盐炒干。日用揩牙洗目。永无齿疾目疾。单用白盐方（据李氏谓光明盐。未知浙闽白盐即号光明否。当再稽考。）漏精白浊。雪白盐一两。筑紧固济。一日。出火毒。白茯苓山药各一两。为末。枣肉和蜜丸梧子大。每枣汤下三十丸。此方甘以济咸。脾肾两得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093708-1hmhybb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-1hmhybb","updated":"20240614093708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕戎盐从西戎来。同是润下之气所凝。而产于极西。寒水孕于母气。故入药似胜，且疗诸血证。非食盐所及。夫用戎盐入温补药。藉元阴之气和阳而归诸阴也。如治聋鸣眩晕沉香磁石丸。及老人腰痛二至丸是。或阴阳均配而用。以至阳根于至阴也。如治白淫之锁精丸是。入固脱药。所以和阴使为阳守也。如治遗精之水中金丹是。或入于活血中。成元阴之本以和血也。如治肾劳淋沥之地黄丸是。推此可以尽其变矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093708-n615fpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093708-n615fpb","updated":"20240614093708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕温水洗去尘土净。晒干入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093625-rzbi2nv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093625-rzbi2nv"}},{"ID":"20240614093656-53v17yk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-53v17yk","updated":"20240614093701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093656-dh8rae4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-dh8rae4","updated":"20240614093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，无毒。主明目、目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊，心腹痛，溺血吐血，齿舌血出。一名胡盐。生胡盐山及西羌北地酒泉福禄城东南角。北海青、南海赤。十月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093656-my3c7k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-my3c7k3","updated":"20240614093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今俗中不复见卤咸，唯魏国所献虏盐，即是河东大盐，形如结冰圆强，味咸、苦，夏月小润液。虏中盐乃有九种∶白盐、食盐，常食者；黑盐，主腹胀气满；胡盐，主耳聋目痛；柔盐，主马脊疮；又有赤盐、驳盐、臭盐、马齿盐四种，并不入食。马齿即大盐，黑盐凝是卤咸，柔盐疑是戎盐，而此戎盐又名胡盐，并主眼痛，二、三相乱。今戎盐虏中甚有，从凉州来，芮芮河南使及北部胡客从敦煌来，亦得之，自是稀少尔。其形作块片，或如鸡鸭卵，或如菱米，色紫白，味不甚咸，口尝气臭，正如 鸡子臭者言真。又河南盐池泥中，自有凝盐如石片，打破皆方，青黑色，善疗马脊疮，又凝世或者。盐虽多种，而戎盐，卤咸最为要用。又巴东朐 县北岸大有盐井，盐水自凝，生粥子盐，方一、二寸，中央突张伞形，亦有方如石膏、博棋者。李云∶戎盐味苦，臭。是海潮水浇山石，经久盐凝着石取之。北海者青，南海者紫赤。又云∶卤咸即是人煮盐釜底凝强盐滓，如此二说并未详。唐本注云∶陶称卤咸，疑是黑盐，此是碱土，议如前说，其戎盐即胡盐。沙州名为秃登盐，廓州名为阴土盐，生河岸山 之阴土石间，块大小不常，坚白似石，烧之不鸣 尔。臣禹锡等谨按陈器云∶盐药，味咸，无毒。主眼赤皆烂风赤，细研水和点目中。又入腹去热烦，痰满，头痛，明目，镇心，水研服之。又主 蛇恶虫毒，疥癣，痈肿，瘰 。以前入腹，水消服之，着疮正尔摩敷。生海西南雷、罗诸州山谷。似芒硝末细，入口极冷。南人多取敷疮肿，少有服者，恐极冷，入腹伤人，且宜慎之。日华子云∶戎盐，平。助水脏，益精气，除五脏症结，心腹积聚，痛疮疥癣等。即西蕃所出，食者号戎盐，又名羌盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093656-r18uxmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-r18uxmo","updated":"20240614093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具食盐条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093656-55m6v2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-55m6v2v","updated":"20240614093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器云∶戎盐累卵。丹房镜源云∶戎盐，赤、黑二色。累卵，干汞，制丹砂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093656-cj7haq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093656-cj7haq8","updated":"20240614093656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶戎盐，成垛，裁之如枕，细白，味甘、咸。亦功在却血。入肾，治目中瘀赤、涩昏。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093625-in5a5uy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093625-in5a5uy"}},{"ID":"20240614093626-20ic7dh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-20ic7dh","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"戎盐"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-1w14vdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-1w14vdw","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ydbxsk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ydbxsk5","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rónɡ Yán"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-2mhdo5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-2mhdo5b","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-jhj6b55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-jhj6b55","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胡盐（《别录》），秃登盐、阴土盐（《唐本草》），石盐、寒盐、冰石（《石药尔雅》），羌盐（《日华子本草》），青盐（《本草图经》），岩盐（《地质矿物学大辞典》），大青盐（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-c8tphmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-c8tphmz","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-wzk5edu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-wzk5edu","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-oh3cp4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-oh3cp4q","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-0u77f3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-0u77f3p","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为卤化物类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石盐的结晶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年可采，一般多在6～8月间进行，自盐湖中取出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-wy9kc6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-wy9kc6b","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-8pl25dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-8pl25dx","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产青海盐湖中，其他如陕西、山东、安徽、云南、甘肃、新疆、内蒙古等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-epvvin5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-epvvin5","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-e7dpvzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-e7dpvzi","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等轴晶系。晶体通常为立方体，集合体成疏松或致密的晶粒状和块状，晶面特具漏斗状之阶梯凹。纯净的石盐为无色透明或白色，但常染成各种颜色，如灰色（染色质常为泥质油点）、黄色（氢氧化铁）、红色（无水氧化铁）、褐色或黑色（有机质）等，有时有蓝色斑点不均匀地分布在其中。条痕为白色。玻璃光泽，稍受风化的表面为脂肪光泽。解理完全。断口呈贝壳状。硬度2.5。比重2.1～2.6。性脆。有咸味。具吸湿性，易溶于水。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-a1uurk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-a1uurk5","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产于炎热干燥地区的盐湖和海滨浅水泻湖中。常与其他盐矿、石膏以及砂岩、粘土等伴生于沉积岩中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-bvlbqr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-bvlbqr5","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ivrkf7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ivrkf7o","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为正方形或不规则多棱形，直径1～2厘米。青白色至暗白色，半透明，多数颗粒均有小形孔洞1至数个，孔洞为圆形或不规则形。质硬，可砸碎，断面洁净而光亮。气微，味咸。以纯净、色青者为佳。易溶于水。水溶液显钠盐与氯化物的各种特殊反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-1ggd73c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-1ggd73c","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-mwimhb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-mwimhb1","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，簸净灰沙。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-0di7fgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-0di7fgc","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ebeec8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ebeec8a","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、肾、膀胱经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-iah0v5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-iah0v5u","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草衍义》：\"入肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-s77yv9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-s77yv9t","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入手足少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-gep76zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-gep76zm","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《长沙药解》：\"入足太阳膀胱经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-rxbq5zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-rxbq5zw","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-1q62oti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-1q62oti","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒，"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-qxfjk7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-qxfjk7i","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味咸，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-de9swoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-de9swoy","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日华子本草》：\"平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ypd52c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ypd52c2","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草衍义》：\"甘，咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-v1oai6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-v1oai6p","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-44fn8bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-44fn8bv","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 水肿忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-wg0j7iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-wg0j7iy","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《得配本草》：\"呕吐者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-m4c4gqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-m4c4gqg","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-mz6j9p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-mz6j9p3","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凉血，明目。治尿血，吐血，齿舌出血，目赤痛，风眼烂弦，牙痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-4z8mutv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-4z8mutv","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主明目、目痛，益气，坚筋骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-syhafln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-syhafln","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经集注》：\"解斑猫、芫青毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ghmr49b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ghmr49b","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"主心腹痛，溺血，吐血，齿舌血出。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-cvfcddg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-cvfcddg","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子木草》：\"助水脏，益梢气，除五脏症结，心腹积聚痛，疮疥癣等。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-9e48qie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-9e48qie","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义》：\"功在却血。治目中瘀赤涩昏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-3dqj2wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-3dqj2wy","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"功同食盐。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-ijgrp4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-ijgrp4k","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草备要》：\"坚骨固齿，明日乌须。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-jw9mdio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-jw9mdio","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-0s0jq8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-0s0jq8o","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5分；或入丸、散。外用：研末揩牙或水化漱口，洗目。"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-dhimmf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-dhimmf3","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-g7andw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-g7andw4","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治远年风赤眼肿痛：青盐、硇砂、石胆各一分。上药用醋浆水一小盏：于瓷器中浸，日中曝之，候其药着于瓷器四畔，干刮取如粟米大，夜卧时着眼两眦，不过三、四度。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-2hwx1cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-2hwx1cg","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风眼烂弦：戎盐化水点之。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-sut5ey3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-sut5ey3","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风热牙痛：青盐一斤，槐枝半斤。水四碗，煎汁二碗，煮盐至干，炒研，日用揩牙。（《唐瑶经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-cwswnc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-cwswnc1","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肾虚齿痛：戎盐一分，地骨皮一两，细辛半两，生地黄（切，焙）一两。上四味粗捣筛。每服五钱匕，水一盏，煎十余沸，去滓热煠，日三。（《圣济总录》戎盐汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-zqb1dee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-zqb1dee","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治浸淫疮：戎盐二分，大黄四分，闾茹一分。上三味捣散，以酒和敷疮上，日三。（《古今录验方》戎盐散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-dcbtzs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-dcbtzs4","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治痔疮漏疮：白矾四两，青盐四两。为末，猪尿脬一个盛之，阴干。每服五钱，空心温水下。（《赵氏经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-nzzkchx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-nzzkchx","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小便不利：茯苓半斤，白术二两，戎盐弹丸大一枚。上三味，以水五升，煮取三升，分温再服。（《金匮要略》茯苓戎盐汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-oqwnrav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-oqwnrav","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治遗尿：戎盐三分，甘草半两（炙微赤，锉），蒲黄一两。白矾三分（烧令汁尽），龙骨一两，鹿角胶二两（捣碎，炒令黄燥）。上药捣细罗为散。每于食前，煎枣汤调下二钱。（《圣惠方》戎盐散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-vrijj78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-vrijj78","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614093626-5t5gpvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093626-5t5gpvi","updated":"20240614093626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614093627-jc5vuf1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614093627-jc5vuf1"}},{"ID":"20240614093628-gorgimz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614093628-gorgimz"}}]}